<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Terms of service</span>
  </nav>
</div>

<section class="wrap wrap-mid" style="padding-bottom:clamp(60px,8vw,110px)">
  <span class="eyebrow">Policy</span>
  <h1 style="margin:14px 0 18px">Terms of service</h1>
  <p class="lede">Written to be read. If anything here is unclear, ask us and we will explain it in plain
    language.</p>

  <div class="stack-32" style="margin-top:44px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--text-dim)">
    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Who you are dealing with</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>This site is operated by <strong class="gold"><%= company.legalName %></strong>, trading as
          <%= company.tradingName %>, of <%= company.addressLines.join(', ') %>. Our company registration is
          <span class="mono"><%= company.registrationNumber %></span> and our tax registration is
          <span class="mono"><%= company.taxNumber %></span>. You can reach us at
          <a class="link-underline" href="mailto:<%= company.email %>"><%= company.email %></a> or on
          <a class="link-underline" href="tel:<%= company.phone.replace(/[^+0-9]/g, '') %>"><%= company.phone %></a>,
          <%= company.hours %>. Full details are on the <a class="link-underline" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
        <p>By using this site or placing an order you agree to these terms. If you do not agree with them, please do
          not order.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">The contract</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>By placing an order you make an offer to buy the goods at the price shown. A contract is formed when we
          confirm the order by email, not when the payment is authorised. If a product is mispriced or has sold out
          we may decline the order and refund you in full.</p>
        <p>All prices are in <%= store.currency %>. <%= store.taxLabel %> and shipping are calculated at checkout and
          shown before you pay. Nothing is added after you press pay.</p>
        <p>We may update these terms; the version in force is the one published when you place your order, and the
          date at the foot of this page changes whenever the text does.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">The goods, described honestly</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>Tea is a natural agricultural product: leaf appearance, aroma intensity and even flavour vary year to
          year and lot to lot. Our tasting notes describe the lot we are currently shipping, and we will always tell
          you if a new harvest differs meaningfully from the previous one.</p>
        <p>Jade and stone are natural materials. Colour, translucency, veining and internal texture vary from piece to
          piece, and no two pieces are identical. Dimensions are given to the nearest millimetre and weights to the
          nearest gram; small variations are normal and are not a defect.</p>
        <p>Some listings on this site carry an <em>Illustration</em> mark. Those images are drawn for the shop rather
          than photographed, they are not a picture of the exact object you will receive, and the
          <a class="link-underline" href="/credits">photography &amp; illustrations</a> page explains how to tell the
          two apart. We will photograph the actual piece and send you the picture before you buy, on request, for any
          listing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Price, payment and title</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>Payment is taken in full at the time of ordering, through <strong>OTT Pay</strong>, on a 3-D Secure 2
          authenticated card transaction. We do not offer payment on account, instalments or cash on delivery. The
          full set of payment terms is in the <a class="link-underline" href="/shipping">shipping policy</a>.</p>
        <p>We reserve the right to change prices and to withdraw products from sale without notice. A price change
          never affects an order we have already confirmed.</p>
        <p>Title to the goods passes to you when we receive payment in full. Risk passes to you on delivery. If a
          parcel is lost in transit before delivery, that risk is ours, not yours — see the
          <a class="link-underline" href="/shipping">shipping policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Age, and lawful use</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>You must be at least 18 years old to order from this site, or the age of majority where you live if that
          is higher. You agree to use the site only for lawful purposes, not to attempt to gain access to any part of
          it you are not authorised to use, and not to place orders you do not intend to pay for.</p>
        <p>It is your responsibility to check that the goods you order may lawfully be imported into your country. We
          tell you where we know a restriction applies, but we cannot know every rule in every destination.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Returns and refunds</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>Returns, exchanges and refunds are governed by the
          <a class="link-underline" href="/refund">refund &amp; returns policy</a>, which forms part of these terms.
          It gives you thirty days from delivery on anything unopened and unused, and it does not limit any stronger
          statutory right you have where you live.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Privacy</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>What we collect, why we need it, who else receives it and how to have it deleted is set out in the
          <a class="link-underline" href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, which also forms part of these terms. In
          short: we never receive or store your full card number, and we do not sell personal data to anyone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Our liability</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>We are responsible for loss you suffer that is a foreseeable result of our breaking these terms or failing
          to use reasonable care. We are not responsible for loss that was not foreseeable, for loss of profit or
          business, or for anything caused by a delay or failure outside our reasonable control — carrier strikes,
          customs action, extreme weather, or a failure of the payment network.</p>
        <p>Our total liability for any order is limited to the amount you paid for that order, except where the law
          does not permit such a limit — liability for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, and for
          fraud, is never limited by these terms.</p>
        <p>Nothing on this site is medical, dietary or investment advice. Jade is sold as a decorative material and
          for cultural appreciation; we make no claim that it has any effect on health or fortune, and any
          gemmological statement we make is based on the certificate supplied with the piece and on the opinion of the
          laboratory that issued it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Governing law</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of <%= company.country %> and of the province in which we are
          established, and the courts there have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute — save that if you are a
          consumer resident elsewhere, you keep the protection of the mandatory consumer law of your own country and
          may bring proceedings in your local courts. Before anything formal, please write to us: almost everything is
          resolved by an email.</p>
        <p class="tiny faint">Last updated <%= policy.updated %>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" id="photo-credits">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px">Photography &amp; illustrations</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:14px">
        Product and editorial photographs on this site are openly licensed images used under the terms of
        their licences, which require attribution. The full list, with author, licence and a link to the
        original file, is published on the
        <a class="link-underline" href="/credits">photography &amp; illustrations</a> page. Listings that carry a
        mark reading <em>Illustration</em> are not photographed at all: they are drawn for the shop, they are not an
        image of any specific item, and we will photograph the actual piece on request before you buy.
      </p>
      <% if (typeof photoCredits !== 'undefined' && photoCredits.length) { %>
        <details class="stack-12">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer;color:var(--gold-200)">Show all <%= photoCredits.length %> attributions</summary>
          <div class="credits" style="margin-top:16px">
            <% photoCredits.forEach(credit => { %>
              <div class="credits-row">
                <span>
                  <% if (credit.source) { %>
                    <a href="<%= credit.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><%= credit.title || credit.slot %></a>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <%= credit.title || credit.slot %>
                  <% } %>
                </span>
                <span><%= credit.author || 'Unknown author' %><% if (credit.via) { %>, via <%= credit.via %><% } %></span>
                <span>
                  <% if (credit.licenceUrl) { %>
                    <a href="<%= credit.licenceUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><%= credit.licence %></a>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <%= credit.licence %>
                  <% } %>
                </span>
              </div>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </details>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row" style="gap:12px;margin-top:40px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/refund">Refund policy</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/shipping">Shipping policy</a>
    <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
  </div>
</section>
